WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:09.490
Many college students devote nearly all their time to study, believing that exercise is a distraction.
许多大学生几乎把所有时间都投入到学习中，认为锻炼会分散精力。

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:15.660
In fact, physical exercise plays an important role in achieving success at college.
事实上，体育锻炼对在大学取得成功起着重要作用。

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:21.350
First and foremost, regular exercise keeps students healthy and energetic.
首先也是最重要的，规律的锻炼能让学生保持健康、精力充沛。

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:29.480
A strong body is the foundation for long hours of study, and students who stay physically active tend to get sick less often.
强健的身体是长时间学习的基础，而坚持运动的学生往往更少生病。

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.670
Second, exercise helps students study more efficiently.
其次，锻炼能帮助学生更高效地学习。

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:41.810
A short run or a game of basketball after hours of reading can relieve stress, clear the mind and improve concentration.
读了几个小时书之后，跑一小段步或打一场篮球，可以缓解压力、清醒头脑并提高专注力。

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:53.780
In addition, team sports build valuable qualities such as cooperation, persistence and the courage to face failure, which are important for success both at college and in the future.
此外，团队运动能培养合作、坚持以及直面失败的勇气等宝贵品质，这些品质无论对在大学还是在将来取得成功都很重要。

00:00:54.580 --> 00:00:58.620
Clearly, college students should make exercise part of their daily routine.
显然，大学生应该让锻炼成为日常生活的一部分。

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:06.610
Even thirty minutes a day, whether spent jogging, swimming or cycling, can make a big difference in their health and studies.
即使每天只锻炼三十分钟，无论是慢跑、游泳还是骑车，都能对他们的健康和学习产生很大的影响。

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:12.990
Students who strike a balance between study and exercise will get the most out of their college years.
在学习和锻炼之间取得平衡的学生，将能最大限度地利用他们的大学时光。
